{
  "story": "Allen Pinto, a 24-year-old man, sat alone on the overnight train from Delhi to Mumbai, clutching a large bag. The rhythmic clatter of wheels against tracks echoed in the quiet carriage. He stared out the window, watching the landscape blur into darkness. The bag, filled with memories and dreams, felt heavier than usual. As dawn approached, he wondered if the journey was more about leaving the past behind than reaching a destination.",
  "mood": "Reflective"
}

